  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Growth Centre (Phase 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve economic growth policies and programmes in 15 DFID focus countries to increase economic development for poverty reduction. This is done through country programmes that provide growth policy advice based on demands from policy makers in partner governments.&#x2019; New policies and programmes from the IGC&#x2019;s policy advice and research work are expected to improve growth for poverty reduction in all partner countries by March 2017.</narrative>
  </description>
